{
  "page": 521,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4682,
      "text": "By the heaven with its pathways[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4683,
      "text": "Indeed, you [Makkans] have conflicting views[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4684,
      "text": "He who is diverted from it is destined to be diverted.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4685,
      "text": "Doomed[3] are those who base their beliefs on conjecture.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4686,
      "text": "those who are steeped in ignorance heedlessly.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4687,
      "text": "They ask [mockingly], “When is the Day of Judgment?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4688,
      "text": "It is the Day when they will be punished by the Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4689,
      "text": "[It will be said], “Taste your punishment! This is what you were seeking to hasten.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4690,
      "text": "Indeed, the righteous will be in gardens and springs,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4691,
      "text": "receiving what their Lord will give them, for they were indeed doers of good beforehand.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4692,
      "text": "They used to sleep only a little at night[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4693,
      "text": "and before dawn they would seek forgiveness[5],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4694,
      "text": "and in their wealth, there was a share for the beggar and the destitute.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4695,
      "text": "On earth there are signs for those who are certain in faith,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4696,
      "text": "and also within yourselves. Do you not see?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4697,
      "text": "And in the heaven is your provision and all that you are promised.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4698,
      "text": "By the Lord of the heaven and earth, this [resurrection] is certainly as true as the fact that you can speak.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 455,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4699,
      "text": "Has there come to you the story of Abraham’s honored guests[6]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4700,
      "text": "When they came to him and said, “Peace.” He said, “Upon you be peace.” [saying to himself] “Unknown people!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4701,
      "text": "Then he went quickly to his household, and came with a fat [roasted] calf,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4702,
      "text": "and placed it before them and said, “Will you not eat?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4703,
      "text": "He felt apprehensive about them[7]. They said, “Do not be afraid,” and gave him glad tidings of a knowledgeable son.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4704,
      "text": "His wife cried out loud, and struck her face [in astonishment] and said, “[I am] a barren old woman!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 521,
      "ruku": 456,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4705,
      "text": "They said, “This is what your Lord said. Indeed, He is the All-Wise, the All-Knowing.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
        "numberOfAyahs": 60,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
